<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="46830894-7582-4a69-8c5a-1837e053a9de" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Middle Earth City States</Name>
    <Stability>Beta</Stability>
    <Teaser>City States and other Allies from the Lord of the Rings</Teaser>
    <Description>The primary goal of this mod is to add City States from the Lord of the Rings into Civ 5 to enhance the Lord of the Rings role playing while using my main mod Middle Earth Civilizations.

If you Like the mod remember to give it a Thumbs Up Rating! If you Love the mod you should make it a Favorite too! 

This mod should be compatible with Vanilla, Gods &amp; Kings, and/or Brave New World. However I have only tested it while using both expansions. The mod uses only XML, and should be compatible with multiplayer if you can figure out how to get it to work. 

The mod is seperate because i wanted to keep it optional. 
You can find a link to Middle Earth Civilizations in the collection above. It requires both Gods and Kings and Brave New World. 

This mod is available in English and Italian. Special thanks to vadoalmax for the Italian Translation.

For Vanilla this mod will include 16 City States.
For Gods and Kings and/or Brave New World this mod includes a total of 26 City States (16 from Vanilla and 10 additional city states)

Some of these are legitimate city states, some are islands or locations that don't necessarily belong to any specific civ, and other's are potential allies or enemies, but not actually a city state. If you disagree with a decision that I have made when choosing these cities, please tell me which one you disagree with and what you would like to see it replaced with. I will not remove any of these just because somebody doesn't like it, but I am willing to replace some of them if needed. I have attempted to keep a balance of the types of city states, and would like to keep it that way.

Military City States:
Avathar (Home of Ungoliant)
Kingdom of Rhovanion
Smaug's Lair
Dunland
Paths of the Dead
Torech Ungol (Aka Shelob's Lair)

Cultured City States:
Crissaegrim
Beorn's Hall
Entwood
Tom Bombadil's House
Eagle's Eyrie

Maritime City States:
Lake Town (Sorry I can't actually make it spawn next to a lake until I do TSL)
Tol Morwen
Tol Fuin
Himling
Lossoth (The name for the Snowman of the Forochel)

Mercantile City States:
Bree
Dale
Dorwinion (Sorry I can't actually make it spawn next to wine until I do TSL)
Esgaroth
Ephel Brandir

Religious City States:
Rhosgobel (Home of Radagast the Brown)
Olorin (Aka Gandolf)
Alatar (One of the Blue Wizards)
Pallando (The other Blue Wizard)
Curumo (Aka Saruman)</Description>
